# Local `gcloud builds submit` needs only the build configuration and backend
# image inputs. Deny everything else so secrets, Git metadata, frontend files,
# and Unity assets are never uploaded with a manual build context.
**
!.gcloudignore
!cloudbuild.yaml
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!backend/
!backend/**

# Backend dependencies, generated output, and local configuration are not
# Cloud Build inputs.
backend/node_modules/
backend/dist/
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
!backend/.env.example

# Kept explicit for auditability even though the allowlist already excludes it.
unity/
